BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Film Screening: The Legacy of Father Joseph T. O'Callahan\, Jesuit
  Chaplain on the USS Franklin
DTSTART:20261008T203000
DTEND:20261008T220000
DTSTAMP:20260921T172750Z
UID:844643f39040e7ac13d5fa4ada6b98@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:From the peaceful classrooms of Holy Cross to the burning deck
 s of a World War II warship\, Rev. Joseph T. O'Callahan\, S.J. lived as a 
 man for others\, leaving behind a quiet legacy through service and Jesuit 
 tradition that continues to shape lives today. Drawn from the feature docu
 mentary "In the Shadow of the USS Franklin"\, currently in post-production
 \, this short film asks what O'Callahan's life of service and sacrifice le
 aves behind\, and where that legacy lives today. Learn more about the docu
 mentary - https://ussfranklindocumentary.com/ --- Event Details: https://m
 yhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2153682 Source: College of the Holy Cross Event 
 page: https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2153682\n\nEvents Near Me: within
