 ster-colleges-events.ics\nSource page: https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=
 2153682
LOCATION:Rehm Library\, One College Street\, Worcester\, Mass 01610\, Unit
 ed States
URL:https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2153682
END:VEVENT
