UID:d16e995aa566d93e19a1acaf9a33ed@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:The purpose of this group is to support students grieving from
  the death of a loved one\, recent or years ago. Participants will have th
 e opportunity to slow down\, take time to reflect upon their grief and the
  person that they have lost and form community with other students. Meetin
 gs are held in the Chaplains' Office and facilitated by Associate Chaplain
